#============================================================

- title: Scheduled task creation
  description: Scheduled tasks are commonly used by malware
    for persistence. Note that this pattern flags all new
    scheduled tasks and hence can very well have false positives.
    Scheduled tasks are also used by benign software, especially for updates.
  category: [persistence, schtask]
  author: emryll
  score: 30

  components:
    - type: etw
      provider: "Microsoft-Windows-TaskScheduler/Operational"
      event: [100]
      name: new_task

  response: alert("Scheduled task creation detected!")

#============================================================

